Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Tue Oct 27 18:17:32 2026 +1100

    api: Import openstacksdk only for ProjectIdMiddleware
    
    neutron.api.extensions imported openstack.connection at module level,
    but only ProjectIdMiddleware uses it, and only for a request that names
    a project. That loaded openstacksdk into the OVN agent, L3 agent and RPC
    server, costing 11 to 13MB of anonymous memory each.
    
    Import it where the Nova connection is first built, and add tests that
    importing the module does not load openstack and that the middleware
    still builds its connection and looks the project up.
    
    Prompt: Mikal asked for privsep memory fixes that can be landed one at a
    time and measured in devstack CI; neutron daemons are the largest.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 (medium effort)
    
    Depends-On: https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/devstack/+/1011992
    Change-Id: If8ebc573bb2ed46e4ef54ec2c78eabdb32dc89a1
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

